### Firebase credentials (push notifications) ###
# The service account key can send a notification to every install of the app.
# Production keeps it in the cooknco-config Secret; see docs/notifications.md.
/config/fcm-service-account.json
# Not secret, but per-project: it names one Firebase project, and a checkout with
# somebody else's would build an app that registers against the wrong one.
/app/androidApp/google-services.json

### Kubernetes migration artefacts (contain database dumps and user uploads) ###
/k8s/migration/backup-*/
/k8s/migration/.last-backup
/k8s/migration/.migration-plan
